e,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,72,44,30,43,72],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[69,72,44,30,43,72],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，诸葛亮北伐期间参军。诸葛亮北伐期间，吴国派遣陆逊等人三路来袭时，奉曹叡之命与满宠前去救援合肥，并夜袭吴军水寨，火烧器具无数，成功逼退诸葛瑾的水军。","tc":"魏國武將，諸葛亮北伐期間參軍。諸葛亮北伐期間，吳國派遣陸遜等人三路來襲時，奉曹叡之命與滿寵前去救援合肥，并夜襲吳軍水寨，火燒器具無數，成功逼退諸葛瑾的水軍。","en":"Officer of Wei, active during Zhuge Liang's Northern Expeditions. When Wu dispatched Lu Xun and others in a three-pronged attack during the Northern Expedition period, he was ordered alongside Man Chong to reinforce Hefei. He launched a night raid on the Wu naval camp, setting fire to countless equipment and supplies, and successfully forced Zhuge Jin's navy to withdraw.","jp":"魏の武将。諸葛亮の北伐期に従軍。諸葛亮の北伐の際、呉が陸遜らを派遣して三路から来襲すると、曹叡の命を受けて満寵と共に合肥の救援に赴き、呉軍の水寨を夜襲して無数の器具を焼き払い、諸葛瑾の水軍を退けることに成功した。","kr":"위나라의 무장으로, 제갈량의 북벌 당시 종군했다. 제갈량의 북벌 당시 오나라가 육손 등을 파견하여 세 갈래 길로 침공해 오자, 조예의 명을 받들어 만총과 함께 합비를 구원하러 나섰다. 이어 오군 수채를 야습하여 수많은 기구를 불태우고 제갈근의 수군을 성공적으로 물리쳤다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10445","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"球","nameTc":"球","nameEn":"Qiu","nameJp":"球","nameKr":"구","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张球","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","wor